# SETI | ASP workshop - Winter 2026

## _Master Your Unistellar Telescope & Do Science That Matters_

Workshop materials for use with your Unistellar smart telescope.

[Learn @ ASP Dashboard](https://learn.astrosociety.org/products/master-your-unistellar-telescope-do-science-that-matters-winter-2026)

# Syllabus

| Week | Topic                                 |
| ---  | ---                                   |
| 1    | Asteroids / Planetary Defense         |
| 2    | Comets / Planetary Defense            |
| 3    | Supernova Remnants & Planetary Nebula |
| 4    | Parallax                              |
| 5    | Supernovae and the Distance Ladder    |

